"legal_help" = "Need help finding a home or using the app?\n\n• Search by location or keyword, or tap the sparkles icon for AI Search.\n• Save listings with the heart and compare up to 3 properties.\n• Turn on search alerts from Saved Searches to hear about new matches.\n\nContact support: support@aipoweredrealestate.com";

"legal_terms" = "Terms & Conditions\n\nBy using SpeddyProp you agree to use listing data for personal property search only. Prices, availability, and details are provided by portals and their listing agents and may change without notice.\n\nIf you request realtor help, you can choose a verified SpeddyProp realtor for your search. That realtor is not the owner of aggregated listings. Enquiries go to your chosen SpeddyProp realtor. Source listing agent details are shown only as property source data.";

"legal_privacy" = "Privacy Policy\n\nWe store your profile, saved searches, favorites, and enquiry history on this device to personalize search and alerts. We do not sell your contact details.\n\nYou can update or remove your information from Edit Profile, or log out at any time.";

